<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <title>ただいまメンテナンス中です | FuzokuZero</title>
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-family: "Hiragino Sans", "Yu Gothic", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #faf7f8;
        color: #2a2a2a;
        padding: 24px;
      }
      .card {
        max-width: 480px;
        width: 100%;
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        border-top: 6px solid #b5204f;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(40, 12, 22, .16);
        padding: 40px 32px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .maintenance-bare {
        max-width: 1000px;
        width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .logo {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        background: linear-gradient(120deg, #e0356b, #b5204f);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      h1 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0 0 16px; }
      p { line-height: 1.7; color: #555; margin: 0; }
      p + p { margin-top: 10px; }
      .maintenance-image { margin: 0 0 20px; }
      .maintenance-image img { max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; display: block; margin: 0 auto; }
      .maintenance-banner { max-width: 360px; margin: 28px auto 0; }
      .maintenance-banner a { display: inline-block; }
      .maintenance-banner img { max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; display: block; }
      .maintenance-banner-link {
        color: #b5204f;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-decoration: underline;
        font-size: .95rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <% if site_setting.maintenance_image.attached? %>
      <%# メンテナンス画像が設定されている場合は、見出し・案内文・カード枠は出さず、
          画像とお問い合わせバナーだけを表示する。 %>
      <div class="maintenance-bare">
        <div class="maintenance-image">
          <%# image_tag on a bare attachment needs a request host to build its
              URL, which this page doesn't have (rendered by
              MaintenanceModeMiddleware via ApplicationController.render, outside
              any request) -- rails_blob_path stays host-less. %>
          <%= image_tag rails_blob_path(site_setting.maintenance_image) %>
        </div>
        <%= render "maintenance/banner", site_setting: site_setting %>
      </div>
    <% else %>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="logo">FuzokuZero</div>
        <h1>ただいまメンテナンス中です</h1>
        <% if site_setting.maintenance_message.present? %>
          <p><%= simple_format site_setting.maintenance_message, {}, wrapper_tag: "span" %></p>
        <% else %>
          <p>ただいまサイトのメンテナンスを行っております。<br>ご不便をおかけしますが、しばらく経ってから再度アクセスください。</p>
        <% end %>

        <%= render "maintenance/banner", site_setting: site_setting %>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </body>
</html>
